<ol style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink);padding-left:18px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 12px;">
<li>Go to <a href="https://console.firebase.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">console.firebase.google.com</a> and sign in with any Google account.</li>
<li>Click <b>Add project</b>, give it any name (e.g. your shop name), keep clicking Continue/Create.</li>
<li>Once inside the project, click <b>Build → Firestore Database → Create database</b>. Choose "Start in test mode" and pick the nearest region.</li>
<li>Click the <b>⚙ gear icon → Project settings</b>, scroll to "Your apps", click the <b>&lt;/&gt; (Web)</b> icon, give it any nickname, click Register app.</li>
<li>Firebase will show a code block with values like apiKey, projectId, etc. Copy each value into the matching box below.</li>
</ol>

<div class="miniLabel">Paste your Firebase details</div>
<input id="syncApiKey" placeholder="apiKey">
<input id="syncAuthDomain" placeholder="authDomain">
<input id="syncProjectId" placeholder="projectId">
<input id="syncStorageBucket" placeholder="storageBucket">
<input id="syncSenderId" placeholder="messagingSenderId">
<input id="syncAppId" placeholder="appId">
<div class="miniLabel">Shop ID</div>
<div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px;">Type the exact same word on every system you want synced together (e.g. <b>sastastore</b>). Different shops must use different Shop IDs.</div>
<input id="syncShopId" placeholder="e.g. sastastore">
<div class="row">
<button class="act btn-primary" style="flex:1" onclick="saveCloudSyncConfig()">Connect this device</button>
<button class="act btn-secondary" style="flex:1" onclick="disconnectCloudSync()">Disconnect</button>
</div>
<div id="syncMsg" style="font-size:12px;margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted);"></div>
<div style="font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px;">Repeat steps 5–6 on every other system, pasting the same values and the same Shop ID. Each system still works fine with no internet — it just syncs whenever it's online.</div>

<div class="miniLabel" style="margin-top:16px;">Fix missing bills / stuck sync</div>
<div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px;">Step 1 — press "Check sync health" on <b>both</b> systems to see actual numbers, not just "Synced". Step 2 — on whichever system is missing bills, press Force full resync.</div>
<button class="act btn-secondary" style="width:100%" onclick="checkSyncHealth()">🩺 Check sync health (compares this device vs cloud)</button>
<div id="syncHealthMsg" style="font-size:12px;margin:6px 0 10px;color:var(--muted);"></div>
<button class="act btn-secondary" style="width:100%" onclick="forceFullResync()">⟳ Force full resync (push this device's data to cloud)</button>
<div id="resyncMsg" style="font-size:12px;margin-top:6px;color:var(--muted);"></div>
</div>

<div class="tabpanel" id="masterTab">
<div class="miniLabel" style="margin-top:0;">Product master data — full catalog</div>
<div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px;">Search by name, code, or barcode. Shows title, unit, sale price, MRP, cost, and current stock for every product.</div>
